WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.710
ESP32 simulator: agri profile has 12 relays and a pump starter

2
00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:07.180
Profiles tab: pump starter START GPIO 33 / STOP GPIO 15

3
00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:10.180
Always pulse-driven: ON pulses START, OFF pulses STOP, then release

4
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:13.340
Duplicate the profile as Dryland farming

5
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.940
Dryland / manavari farms have no pump: delete the pump starter

6
00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:21.490
Apply to device: pins.pump = 0 removes the starter

7
00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:25.380
Dashboard hides the pump card and no pump GPIO is pulsed

8
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.810
Profiles now offers + Add pump starter instead of GPIO fields

9
00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:32.940
Reload confirms the dryland profile persists without a pump

10
00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:37.400
Hardware self test: Pump starter reported as not fitted

11
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.180
Back to agri: pump starter is present on GPIO 33 / 15

12
00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:44.650
Apply agri to restore the original profile

13
00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:47.520
Pump card returns on the dashboard

14
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:50.080
Manual ON pulses START GPIO 33, then releases

15
00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.640
Manual OFF pulses STOP GPIO 15, then releases

16
00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:55.770
Reload confirms the original agri profile is intact

17
00:00:55.770 --> 00:01:00.200
Delete or add the pump starter per farm — no pump GPIO for dryland
